{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_XBOX__"}}----

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_XBOX__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time when the original Xbox
	target is being used.  It can be used to compile parts of a program only
	for the Xbox target.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#IFDEF __FB_XBOX__
	print "Xbox target"
#ENDIF
%%

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Predefined Defines"}}
